# Local, personal agent guidance -- never committed. AGENTS.LOCAL.md holds the
# things that are Jon's rather than the project's (how to quote him publicly,
# what must never be written down). CLAUDE.LOCAL.md is a symlink to it so the
# two cannot drift.
*.LOCAL.md

# agent-estate#821: worktree.sh new's default location for every lane
# worktree it creates for THIS repo (WORKTREE_ROOT still overrides it).
# Unignored, `git status`/`worktree.sh guard` in the main checkout would
# report every linked worktree under here as an untracked directory --
# confirmed live: `git worktree add .worktrees/x` followed by `git status
# --porcelain` in the main checkout prints `?? .worktrees/` until this is
# in place.
/.worktrees/

# src/tui/ build artifacts (agent-tui's own .gitignore, re-anchored under
# src/tui/ now that it's a subdirectory rather than its own repo root, then
# moved again by agent-estate#865/#867's tui/ -> src/tui move)
/src/tui/estate
/src/tui/agent-tui
/src/tui/bin/
*.test
/src/tui/testdata/vhs/out/
